From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mxreyer <236478497+mxreyer@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 11:24:55 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] conv: BC-250 investigation knobs (local, not for upstream)

Environment overrides used for the measurements in OPENCL-PERF.md:
DLPRIM_CONV_ALGO / DLPRIM_CONV_{FWD,BWD_DATA,BWD_FILTER}_ALGO,
DLPRIM_WINOGRAD_KSPLIT (incl. "stock" for the original rule),
DLPRIM_WINOGRAD_KSPLIT_TARGET/MAX, DLPRIM_WINOGRAD_{SPLIT,BWD}_PLANES,
DLPRIM_WINOGRAD_STRIDE_OFFSET/TR_OFFSET, and the DLPRIM_DEBUG_PARTIALS_HASH
diagnostic that located the governor-voltage wrong-gradient issue.
---
 src/core/conv.cpp | 218 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 181 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

